{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42180","headline":"翰林游舍人清明日入院中途见过余明日亦入西省上直因寄游君 · 徐铉","name":"翰林游舍人清明日入院中途见过余明日亦入西省上直因寄游君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"榆柳开新焰，梨花发故枝。\n辎軿隘城市，圭组坐曹司。\n独对芝泥检，遥怜白马儿。\n禁林还视草，气味两相知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42180.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42180","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}